### Beginner-Friendly Development Approach

Initially, don't try to connect Blinkit, Zepto or BigBasket directly.

Start with your own sample grocery database.

For example:

| Product | Store A | Store B | Store C |
| ------- | ------: | ------: | ------: |
| Rice    |    ₹300 |    ₹280 |    ₹320 |
| Sugar   |     ₹45 |     ₹42 |     ₹48 |
| Milk    |     ₹60 |     ₹58 |     ₹62 |

Develop the complete comparison functionality using this data.

After the application works properly, integrate real store data through authorized sources.

This will make development much easier.

