# 12. Possible Challenges

| Challenge                   | Possible Solution                                 |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Getting live grocery prices | Use authorized APIs or shopkeeper updates.        |
| Different product sizes     | Match products using brand, weight and quantity.  |
| Incorrect prices            | Regularly update price information.               |
| Location-based availability | Use PIN code or location services.                |
| Delivery charges            | Include additional charges in total calculations. |
| Multiple stores             | Develop a store registration system.              |

One important point: Always compare identical products. For example, 1 kg of Aashirvaad Atta should not be compared directly with 5 kg of Aashirvaad Atta. Also, compare the final bill rather than only product prices. ([BudgetBasket][2])

