# 14. Project Abstract (For College Submission)

You can use the following as your initial project abstract:

## Project Title: SmartBasket – Grocery Cost Comparison Application

### Abstract

SmartBasket is a grocery price comparison application designed to help users purchase everyday grocery products at affordable prices. The application allows users to search for grocery items, create shopping lists and compare product prices across multiple grocery stores and online shopping platforms.

The system analyses available product prices and identifies the stores offering the lowest prices. It also provides information about discounts, product availability and total shopping expenses. Additional features such as budget tracking, price history, nearby store recommendations and price drop notifications help users make better purchasing decisions.

The main objective of this application is to save customers' money and time by providing a convenient platform for comparing grocery prices. It also aims to support local grocery shops by allowing them to register and display their product prices.

SmartBasket promotes budget-friendly shopping, price transparency and smarter purchasing decisions.

